{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentTower","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentTower","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeTauAssignmentH3","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4StabilizationRung"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH4_surjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH4_surjective","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentTower.lean#L114-L120","doc":"Surjectivity onto the isotypic slot transports up the tower through\nthe square: the H4 assignment is onto, witnessed by `ι₃₄`-pushforwards\nof the H3 witnesses. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignment_tower_natural_bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignment_tower_natural_bar","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentTower.lean#L108-L112","doc":"The ρ-partner square. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignment_tower_natural","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignment_tower_natural","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentTower.lean#L101-L106","doc":"**THE ι₃₄ COMPATIBILITY SQUARE**: the H4-rung assignment restricted\nalong the tower inclusion IS the H3-rung assignment. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:tau-assignment-tower-square","label":"prop:tau-assignment-tower-square","md":"quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/tau-assignment-tower-square.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.tauAssignmentH4","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentTower.lean#L78-L99","doc":"**The H4-rung τ-assignment**: the three H3-prefix coker-dual\nfunctionals on the 24-dimensional module, into the 3-dim isotypic slot\nof the genus-4 `H^{1,0}` model. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.iota34_monodromyN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.iota34_monodromyN","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentTower.lean#L67-L76","doc":"**The domain square**: the tower inclusion intertwines the\nnilpotents, `ι₃₄ ∘ N₃ = N₄ ∘ ι₃₄` — the monodromy weight structure is\ntower-natural. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.h4_mulσ₀_eq_mulStep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.h4_mulσ₀_eq_mulStep","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentTower.lean#L60-L65","doc":"The extraction certificate: the pinned `H4.mulσ₀` table IS `mulStep`\nof `descentH4σ₀` (the σ₀ analogue of the merged `h4_mulσ₂_eq_mulStep`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentH4σ₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentH4σ₀","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeTauAssignmentTower.lean#L49-L58","doc":"The σ₀ right-multiplication descent structure on the 24-element S₄\nNF basis, extracted from the preflight-pinned `H4.mulσ₀` table. The\n6-element prefix is the H3 cell (`descentH3σ₀`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}